  "display_name": "DNA Siphon",
  "display_fullname": "Guardian Comp Organic Composition DNA Siphon",
  "display_help": "You can siphon genetic material from nearby enemies, causing a minor amount of Lethal damage and a minor amount of Toxic damage over time. Living enemies will provide the user with a small boost to health and endurance. These foes will have their regeneration rate reduced for a short period of time. Defeated enemies provide a weaker sample of material and thus will boost recovery and regeneration for a short while. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Long",
  "display_short_help": "PBAoE, Minor DMG(Lethal/Toxic), Foe -Regen; Self +HP, +End",
